	// `server/src/services/api_tokens/handlers.rs:199-217`.
	RevokeMachineCredential(context.Context, *connect.Request[v1.RevokeMachineCredentialRequest]) (*connect.Response[v1.RevokeMachineCredentialResponse], error)
